Package: composableIDModelR
Type: Package
Title: Composable Infectious Disease Models via 'ComposableTuringIDModels.jl'
Version: 0.2.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Sebastian", "Funk", email = "sebastian.funk@lshtm.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides an R interface to 'ComposableTuringIDModels.jl', the
    composable probabilistic infectious disease modelling package of the
    'EpiAware' ecosystem. Models are assembled in R from reusable latent
    process, infection and observation components, then simulated from and
    fitted to data in 'Julia' using 'Turing.jl', without requiring 'Julia'
    expertise.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
